OL,3,GNEWSAFaulty valve on pipe causes water 
OL,4,Ato shoot into air                      
OL,6,FA faulty valve on a pipe caused water  
OL,7,Fto shoot into the air on a busy road in
OL,8,FNottingham, leading to disruption.     
OL,10,FA water jet was seen coming from the   
OL,11,Fpipe in Hucknall Road, Sherwood, at    
OL,12,Fabout 12:45 GMT on Monday.             
OL,14,FEngineers have since stopped the flow  
OL,15,Fof water, and are now working to repair
OL,16,Fthe damage, Severn Trent said.         
OL,18,FThe supplier said the problem was      
OL,19,Fcaused by one of its clean water pipes 
OL,20,Fhaving a faulty valve, and confirmed no
OL,21,Fcustomers had been affected.           
